  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">ICRC operations by the South Sudan Delegation(2025 Unaudited)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The ICRC helps conflict-affected communities in South Sudan become self-sufficient and reunites families. We visit places of detention, support health care facilities, and promote respect for international humanitarian law.Here&apos;s the latest news coming out of South Sudan:A South Sudan humanitarian crisisSouth Sudan citiesSouth Sudan newsSouth Sudan womenSouth Sudan refugee crisis</narrative>
  </description>
